1
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,360
Watch out!

2
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,960
He has bombs too?

3
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,160
Hey. Where are you going?

4
00:02:07,240 --> 00:02:08,720
You damn coward.

5
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,360
Will you trade lives with me, Thatri?

6
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,640
As you wish.

7
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,680
Auntie? Visiting the post this frequently,

8
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:20,000
<i>something must be going on.</i>

9
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:30,640
All this time,
have you ever actually loved me?

10
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:35,360
Please bring Miss Rajit back quickly.
Mr. Vijarn is crossing the line.

11
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:37,800
<i>He's trying to take over</i>
<i>all of her duties.</i>

12
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:40,560
DOCTOR SOMSAK

13
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:16,920
You look more attractive while sleeping.

14
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:25,000
Should I just drop dead then,
so I can stay handsome forever?

15
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,680
Could you?

16
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:43,000
If I say yes, are you going to murder me?

17
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,600
Why would I do that?

18
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:48,760
Life without you would be boring.

19
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,840
Do you want me by your side forever?

20
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:04,880
Can you?

21
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,120
Fine.

22
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,400
But if I have to leave you for a while…

23
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,400
No way.

24
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,840
If it's absolutely necessary,

25
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,160
will you wait for me?

26
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,960
If you promise to return,

27
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,800
I will wait.

28
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:39,720
Regarding the investigation,

29
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:43,840
the real Thatri turns out
to be a friend of our Thatri.

30
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:47,840
They have known each other since school.

31
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:52,680
Then we must nip this in the bud.

32
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:55,560
We can't let the real Thatri
set foot in Phuket.

33
00:05:57,240 --> 00:06:00,800
No need to tell me that.
I've already taken care of it.

34
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:10,760
If the real Thatri knows about this,
he can be of great help to us.

35
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,840
I just sent a telegram
to that Wild Bull this morning.

36
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,880
He should arrive in Phuket in two days,

37
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:20,120
and we can finally end this.

38
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,880
All that's left is evidence
to arrest Mr. Vijarn.

39
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,680
Excuse me, District Chief.

40
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:33,280
-Is something wrong?
-A fire just broke out at the post office.

41
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:39,080
Then your friend Thatri won't know

42
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,160
that we need him here in Phuket.

43
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:49,680
I used to wonder why Thatri
visited the post office so often.

44
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:52,520
Thank you for making my plan go smoothly.

45
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,480
We're business partners now,

46
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,840
so we back each other up.

47
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,880
Though, Thatri,

48
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:03,520
he's certainly persistent,

49
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:06,360
constantly coming to Rajit's rescue.

50
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:08,080
He's in love with Rajit.

51
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:11,280
Even if he denies it, anyone
with a brain can see through him.

52
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:20,360
You look worried.

53
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:25,480
Well… it's about Wai.

54
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,800
I still haven't found
a way to silence him.

55
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,080
For that matter,

56
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,880
you should be thanking me too.

57
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,560
He's here, sir.

58
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:53,760
This is the janitor
who cleans Wai's room every day.

59
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:57,360
Tell me. What did you overhear?

60
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:02,720
The patient suffered severe brain trauma.

61
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:05,400
I can't say when he'll wake up

62
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:08,840
or if he'll ever be the same

63
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,400
and able to testify.

64
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:15,640
Then Wai is as good as dead.

65
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:18,160
How can he testify for me now?

66
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,920
That's everything I overheard.

67
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:43,320
Now you can stop worrying. All that's left

68
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:46,160
is to find Rajit, marry her,

69
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:49,760
and all the fortune will be yours.

70
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:55,200
I've searched all over Phuket,
but still can't find her.

71
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:57,160
I have no idea where she's hiding.

72
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,720
We must track her down.

73
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:02,680
She owns numerous businesses,

74
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:06,800
and we need them to distribute the drugs.

75
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:09,800
Understood.

76
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,400
Don't worry.

77
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:17,800
Your drugs will definitely be sold here.

78
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,560
I brought some food for you.

79
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:35,720
Since you're staying here by yourself,
I feared you might go hungry.

80
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:37,640
These are all your favorites.

81
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,960
Thank you so much.

82
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:42,440
All right, I'll be going now.

83
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,480
-Okay.
-Let's go, Nid.

84
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,800
DOCTOR SOMSAK

85
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:10,880
Wow. Not only are you crashing here,

86
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,600
but you also brought your work.

87
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:14,160
Why don't you just move in permanently?

88
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:19,400
No. I have to go back
to Som Song Saeng eventually.

89
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:21,800
There are many people there I worry about.

90
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:23,560
Well…

91
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:25,360
I was being sarcastic.

92
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:29,880
Since I'm staying with you,

93
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:32,120
I want to make myself useful.

94
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:35,480
Just let me know if you need any help.

95
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:45,640
Doctor, help. Someone
is having a seizure on the road.

96
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,880
Look at that.
Your wish came true instantly.

97
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:48,800
Come along.

98
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,440
-Over there.
-Lead the way.

99
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:54,960
-What do we do?
-How's she?

100
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,760
Did you go fetch a doctor?

101
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,760
Where's a doctor?

102
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,840
Hurry! This way!

103
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:00,880
Alright.

104
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:04,240
Move back! Give her some space!

105
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,600
-Okay.
-Excuse me.

106
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,120
Rajit,

107
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,240
find something to support her head.

108
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:11,920
-Can I borrow your loincloth?
-Yeah, sure.

109
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,960
-Help me turn her onto her side.
-Yes.

110
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:21,760
Stay calm. Just relax.

111
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,960
Does anyone have a fan?

112
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:37,080
Just hang in there.

113
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:02,320
Why are you smiling like that?
Are you losing your mind?

114
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:05,000
Not at all.

115
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:09,160
It was actually fun helping out.
Staying cooped up is getting boring.

116
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,480
If you're bored…

117
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:19,320
then come back to Som Song Saeng House.

118
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:37,320
Has Zhang Gong Cheng agreed
to talk and help us yet?

119
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:43,320
Not at all. It doesn't look like
he will cooperate easily.

120
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:47,320
Wai is still unconscious.

121
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:50,200
Mr. Vijarn will continue
to walk free for quite a while.

122
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:55,680
I desperately want to arrest him,

123
00:12:55,760 --> 00:12:58,800
so Rajit can return
to Som Song Saeng House in peace.

124
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:12,480
Mr. Thatri! We have a problem, sir!

125
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:16,480
-This is bad, sir.
-What is it?

126
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:18,200
Mr. Vijarn found Miss Rajit.

127
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:20,040
She's being held at Som Song Saeng House.

128
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,320
While you were away,

129
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:38,160
I completed the transfer of all assets

130
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:40,440
to you as the sole owner.

131
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:47,040
Grandpa's fortune isn't going anywhere,

132
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:50,360
and I'm in no rush to claim it.

133
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:53,240
There was no need for you to rush this.

134
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:59,160
Hey, you. While you were away,

135
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:03,120
Vijarn took the reins
and controlled everything

136
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:04,880
as if it belonged to him.

137
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:09,400
That's not true at all.

138
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:12,400
I only wanted to ensure
everything was properly handled.

139
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:15,200
I was simply looking out
for my future wife.

140
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,720
And you don't even want to ask

141
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:22,040
why I disappeared
from our engagement party?

142
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:28,280
Hey, just tell him the truth.

143
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:31,560
You fled the engagement
because you have no desire to marry him.

144
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:38,000
That doesn't matter.

145
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:40,960
As long as you don't run away

146
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:43,280
on our wedding day.

147
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,720
Miss Rajit, don't reject my offer.

148
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,360
If you don't agree…

149
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:08,040
Thatri will be the first one I destroy.

150
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:12,120
I can't guarantee the safety

151
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:14,720
of anyone else here either.

152
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:16,840
Think wisely.

153
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:25,720
Everything I say is backed by reason.

154
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:28,480
I hope you understand that.

155
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:35,360
Hey. What are you trying to do to her?

156
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:41,000
Had I known your true colors,
I wouldn't have supported you back then.

157
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:48,920
If there are no further objections,

158
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:51,160
I will finalize the inheritance

159
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:55,160
and rush our wedding
as quickly as possible.

160
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,520
In that case…

161
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:17,680
Apologies for the interruption,

162
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:20,280
but someone is here to see you.

163
00:16:44,560 --> 00:16:47,360
Auntie. Uncle Thatri.

164
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:08,839
How can we be certain
this is the real Thatri

165
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:10,000
and not the…

166
00:17:12,319 --> 00:17:14,000
the fake one from before?

167
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:16,400
There's no need to question this.

168
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,280
I can personally vouch for him

169
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:20,640
because I've met Aunt Suang before.

170
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:27,000
It's been a long time.
How have you been, dear?

171
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:31,120
I'm doing well, Auntie.

172
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,240
But it has been decades.

173
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:37,320
You might be mistaken.

174
00:17:37,880 --> 00:17:39,440
I can attest to that as well.

175
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:43,040
I've worked here since Mr. Som was young

176
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:45,360
and used to serve Ms. Suang.

177
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:48,360
This is definitely him, without a doubt.

178
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,520
Since everyone confirms it,

179
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:56,000
that's fine.

180
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:02,080
As Ms. Suang and Mr. Thatri

181
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:04,280
are Miss Rajit's remaining elders,

182
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:05,960
allow me to state that I'm Vijarn.

183
00:18:08,320 --> 00:18:09,680
I'm Miss Rajit's lover,

184
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:13,640
and we are getting married soon.

185
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:27,000
As Rajit's elder,

186
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:29,760
I do not permit this marriage.

187
00:18:31,680 --> 00:18:33,000
I barely know you,

188
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:36,080
and Rajit is still too young.

189
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:38,280
She has time to learn about love.

190
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:41,360
Trust me, dear. There's no rush.

191
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:44,840
Alright. I will do exactly

192
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:46,520
as you say.

193
00:18:57,240 --> 00:18:58,840
Have it your way,

194
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:01,360
but let me tell you one thing.

195
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:07,480
Mr. Thatri will not inherit
anything under the will.

196
00:19:09,280 --> 00:19:11,600
The deadline has passed,

197
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:15,120
so you have no right to the fortune.

198
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:18,200
Everything belongs solely to Miss Rajit.

199
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:22,600
I'm more than happy
to split the fortune equally with him

200
00:19:22,680 --> 00:19:24,200
as originally intended.

201
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:26,520
It gives us an extra hand to manage,

202
00:19:26,600 --> 00:19:29,800
and it won't be a heavy burden
on Aunt Paetai and me.

203
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:34,600
Rajit is absolutely right.

204
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:37,200
We have extra help now.

205
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:39,240
Vijarn,

206
00:19:40,200 --> 00:19:43,400
if you receive any other job offers,

207
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:44,760
do not hesitate to go.

208
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:49,920
Don't worry.

209
00:19:50,520 --> 00:19:54,360
I'm ready to learn the business
and assist Paetai and Rajit.

210
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:58,040
Wonderful.

211
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:02,560
In that case, you don't need to petition
the court for a new asset transfer.

212
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:05,040
The outcome remains identical anyway.

213
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,560
It would be a waste of time.

214
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:33,000
-Wild Bull?
-You Leopard!

215
00:20:33,680 --> 00:20:34,800
-Hey.
-Hey.

216
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:39,960
-Have you been here long?
-Just a short while.

217
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:43,240
Where is Rajit?

218
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,920
Rajit is in the office with Paetai.

219
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:49,800
Jiam is getting the bedrooms ready,
so we're waiting out here.

220
00:20:51,400 --> 00:20:52,640
Mother Suang.

221
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:55,720
Are you doing well, Thatri?

222
00:20:58,240 --> 00:21:01,160
Not really. I nearly ended up
in prison a few times.

223
00:21:05,040 --> 00:21:08,200
In prison? Why didn't you send a telegram

224
00:21:08,280 --> 00:21:12,280
so I could rush over?
We spent a week vacationing in Phang Nga.

225
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:17,120
You said you'd rush over
after her appendix surgery.

226
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:19,400
Turns out you guys
were just vacationing instead.

227
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:23,480
How was I supposed to know?

228
00:21:23,560 --> 00:21:27,120
I figured you wanted
to stay here for as long as possible.

229
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:36,440
Ms. Suang, the rooms are ready.

230
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:40,080
-Thank you, Jiam.
-Would you like to go up and rest now?

231
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:43,680
Not yet. There is somewhere
I need to visit first.

232
00:21:51,440 --> 00:21:54,040
I have read your journal.

233
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:57,840
Rajit also personally told me

234
00:21:58,680 --> 00:22:00,960
how deeply you regretted

235
00:22:01,040 --> 00:22:03,200
what you did to me.

236
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:08,880
I forgive you completely.

237
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:40,280
I'm so glad you came.

238
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:43,000
I'm happy too.

239
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:14,640
Thank you…

240
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,800
I'm happy too.

241
00:23:40,760 --> 00:23:43,480
How does it feel
to be a future millionaire?

242
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:46,880
Usually, my bedroom
is no different from a worker's quarters.

243
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:50,080
I probably can't sleep tonight
on such a soft bed.

244
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:54,640
Congratulations.

245
00:23:57,560 --> 00:24:00,680
Sorry for leaving you
to suffer for so long, Leopard.

246
00:24:00,760 --> 00:24:04,800
Fine. Don't bring it up again.
It still frustrates me.

247
00:24:13,080 --> 00:24:14,480
What's on your mind?

248
00:24:17,920 --> 00:24:19,200
I'm worried about Rajit.

249
00:24:21,560 --> 00:24:22,520
Don't tell me

250
00:24:22,600 --> 00:24:25,200
you didn't want Rajit
to return to Som Song Saeng House.

251
00:24:25,280 --> 00:24:27,840
You kept her at the clinic for days.

252
00:24:27,920 --> 00:24:31,080
It's not that. I'm concerned about safety.

253
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:35,640
The criminal is still at large.
Rajit could be attacked at any time.

254
00:24:36,560 --> 00:24:38,200
It seems you're not just worried.

255
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:43,080
You're protective and jealous
of her and that lawyer.

256
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:47,240
Don't think I didn't hear what you said

257
00:24:47,320 --> 00:24:48,840
at the railway station that day.

258
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:53,480
-Heard what?
-Well, what did you say?

259
00:24:57,280 --> 00:24:58,360
Wild Bull,

260
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:04,280
what would you say
if I told you I like Rajit?

261
00:25:10,360 --> 00:25:11,480
You heard me.

262
00:25:14,760 --> 00:25:17,560
If you like Rajit, just go tell her.

263
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:18,920
You have my permission.

264
00:25:23,440 --> 00:25:24,840
Wild Bull,

265
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:27,560
you know my current situation.

266
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:30,480
I have absolutely nothing left to my name.

267
00:25:30,560 --> 00:25:32,880
Rajit deserves someone better than me.

268
00:25:34,840 --> 00:25:36,760
I've only met Rajit a couple of times,

269
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:41,200
but I can tell that something like this
wouldn't make her look down on you.

270
00:25:43,040 --> 00:25:45,720
Even so, I don't have
the audacity to pursue her.

271
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:47,760
I refuse to mooch off a woman.

272
00:25:49,120 --> 00:25:51,920
You know how much my pride matters to me.

273
00:25:56,320 --> 00:25:59,120
Is it more important
than the love you two share?

274
00:26:11,560 --> 00:26:14,240
Yes. It is more important.

275
00:26:37,280 --> 00:26:39,480
Even though we're not
related by blood anymore,

276
00:26:40,280 --> 00:26:42,120
it is still impossible.

277
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:04,760
The moment I learned
what gypsophila means,

278
00:27:04,840 --> 00:27:06,760
you immediately came to mind.

279
00:27:06,840 --> 00:27:08,680
What does it mean?

280
00:27:09,840 --> 00:27:11,600
An innocent heart.

281
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:14,720
I suppose I really am innocent.

282
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:19,320
An innocent fool

283
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:22,480
who foolishly hoped to be loved by him.

284
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:46,840
Do you always wear that necklace?

285
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:53,600
Aren't you wearing yours?

286
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:18,240
It has been days now.

287
00:28:18,320 --> 00:28:20,760
Cooperate and testify as my witness.

288
00:28:20,840 --> 00:28:22,080
Your sentence will be reduced.

289
00:28:24,280 --> 00:28:25,920
Why keep protecting Vijarn?

290
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:27,640
If he finds out you're alive,

291
00:28:27,720 --> 00:28:29,840
he will definitely come to eliminate you.

292
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:32,200
Your only way out

293
00:28:32,280 --> 00:28:34,360
is to testify against them.

294
00:28:37,080 --> 00:28:40,280
I know all that.
A thief like me has dignity.

295
00:28:40,360 --> 00:28:42,760
I kill anyone who betrays me,

296
00:28:42,840 --> 00:28:44,800
but I never betray anyone first.

297
00:28:45,840 --> 00:28:46,960
More importantly,

298
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:50,400
I despise you and the police even more.

299
00:28:53,520 --> 00:28:56,480
Mom! Let go! Can't you even give me this?

300
00:28:56,560 --> 00:28:58,880
-Give it here!
-No!

301
00:28:58,960 --> 00:29:00,960
How are we going to afford food?!

302
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:03,720
I need this for my business!
Please don't take it!

303
00:29:03,800 --> 00:29:05,320
Officers, please go check on that.

304
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:09,080
I'll watch Zhang Gong Cheng myself,
in case you need to assist out there.

305
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:10,200
Give me!

306
00:29:10,280 --> 00:29:13,280
He's in handcuffs. It's perfectly safe.

307
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:14,600
-Understood.
-Understood.

308
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:18,320
Give it to me!

309
00:29:20,760 --> 00:29:21,600
-Hey!
-Stop!

310
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,880
-You won't give it to me? Huh?
-Stop!

311
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:25,960
Give me!

312
00:29:26,040 --> 00:29:27,280
Give it to me!

313
00:29:27,360 --> 00:29:28,600
Damn it!

314
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:30,760
Hand it over!

315
00:29:30,840 --> 00:29:33,880
-Give it here!
-Hey! Is this a robbery?

316
00:29:34,480 --> 00:29:38,000
I'm not robbing anyone! She's family!
Mind your own business!

317
00:29:38,080 --> 00:29:40,160
How can you assault
your own flesh and blood?

318
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:42,440
-Give me!
-You ungrateful scoundrel!

319
00:29:42,520 --> 00:29:44,720
He wants to spend it on God knows what!

320
00:29:44,800 --> 00:29:46,400
When I refuse, he goes wild!

321
00:29:46,480 --> 00:29:48,400
If I give it to him, he'll just buy more.

322
00:29:48,480 --> 00:29:50,520
We have nothing left for food!

323
00:29:50,600 --> 00:29:52,240
He acts like an opium addict.

324
00:29:53,080 --> 00:29:54,400
-Don't!
-Damn it!

325
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:00,080
You can guess the reason.

326
00:30:00,160 --> 00:30:01,120
Let go!

327
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:04,000
Let me go!

328
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:07,640
Argh! Let go!

329
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:09,760
This is the reality of heroin.

330
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:12,600
This is the work you helped Vijarn create.

331
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:18,480
The shipment they took
is already spreading to the public.

332
00:30:19,080 --> 00:30:21,080
It is a thousand times worse than opium.

333
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:23,400
It drives a person
to beat their own mother.

334
00:30:23,480 --> 00:30:24,680
That's your own family!

335
00:30:24,760 --> 00:30:27,000
It turns human beings into monsters.

336
00:30:27,080 --> 00:30:29,560
Get off me! Let me go!

337
00:31:03,480 --> 00:31:07,080
What exactly did I do wrong
to remove me from management?

338
00:31:08,040 --> 00:31:09,080
There is no mistake.

339
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:13,160
You're a lawyer. Legal practice
is your primary specialty.

340
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:15,440
Focusing on legal matters
suits your expertise best.

341
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:18,720
I'll take care of the rest.

342
00:31:18,800 --> 00:31:21,360
But my management
has been completely flawless.

343
00:31:22,280 --> 00:31:25,440
Well, now you have me.
I'll handle the management,

344
00:31:25,520 --> 00:31:28,400
and you handle the law.
It works perfectly.

345
00:31:30,040 --> 00:31:32,360
Indeed, very perfect.

346
00:31:33,640 --> 00:31:36,600
However, with only
a high school education,

347
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:39,840
overseeing an entire company

348
00:31:41,040 --> 00:31:42,360
will hardly be an easy task.

349
00:31:44,040 --> 00:31:46,880
True, it's not easy.

350
00:31:48,440 --> 00:31:51,080
It's a massive task for me.

351
00:31:52,440 --> 00:31:54,760
But learning is necessary.

352
00:31:54,840 --> 00:31:56,960
It's my business and fortune, after all.

353
00:31:57,680 --> 00:32:00,240
Who else would run it? Right?

354
00:32:01,560 --> 00:32:04,840
Fortunately, Rajit and Paetai
are helping out.

355
00:32:06,280 --> 00:32:07,880
I plan to enroll in further studies.

356
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,520
How about we study together?

357
00:32:09,600 --> 00:32:11,720
We could be classmates.

358
00:32:14,080 --> 00:32:16,080
No, thank you.

359
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:18,520
If that is all, I'll leave.

360
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:26,240
Why the sudden anger?
It was just a friendly offer.

361
00:32:40,480 --> 00:32:41,680
That bastard.

362
00:32:43,240 --> 00:32:46,320
Barely arrived, yet already daring
to dismiss me.

363
00:32:53,080 --> 00:32:55,080
The police need this done
as quickly as possible.

364
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,600
Please expedite the process.

365
00:32:56,680 --> 00:32:57,600
Yes, Miss Rajit.

366
00:33:06,600 --> 00:33:07,960
Miss Rajit,

367
00:33:09,240 --> 00:33:10,600
was that Manop?

368
00:33:11,800 --> 00:33:15,280
Are we having some trouble
with our transport vehicles

369
00:33:15,360 --> 00:33:16,760
that brought him here?

370
00:33:22,240 --> 00:33:24,000
Is something wrong?

371
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:28,720
It is a secret.

372
00:33:29,640 --> 00:33:31,960
The authorities requested
our transport to Bangkok

373
00:33:32,560 --> 00:33:35,800
for a high-profile suspect.

374
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:37,560
They avoid using regular vehicles.

375
00:33:38,240 --> 00:33:40,000
That high-profile?

376
00:33:40,720 --> 00:33:41,920
May I ask who it is?

377
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:45,480
The pirate, Zhang Gong Cheng.

378
00:33:45,560 --> 00:33:47,080
-But he died--
-Hush…

379
00:33:51,480 --> 00:33:52,480
I'm sorry.

380
00:33:53,520 --> 00:33:57,400
He survived. The investigation
is being kept classified

381
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:59,840
while he is transferred to Bangkok

382
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:03,400
to turn a state witness against
the mastermind behind the operations.

383
00:34:07,360 --> 00:34:08,320
I see.

384
00:34:28,199 --> 00:34:29,920
Then I'll change the method.

385
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:34,120
How about one Thatri…

386
00:34:34,960 --> 00:34:36,199
Two Thatri…

387
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:40,719
Are you trying to sneak into my dreams?

388
00:34:42,040 --> 00:34:43,080
Is that possible?

389
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:54,960
Good night.

390
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:10,400
Everything is prepared, Mr. Thatri.

391
00:35:11,560 --> 00:35:12,600
In that case, let's move.

392
00:35:33,160 --> 00:35:35,560
-Is everything clear?
-Yes, sir.

393
00:35:35,640 --> 00:35:38,440
Make sure no one knows
Zhang Gong Cheng is alive.

394
00:35:39,640 --> 00:35:42,160
Rest assured. We will keep our guard up.

395
00:35:42,240 --> 00:35:43,800
This is the final opportunity.

396
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:47,800
Upon arrival in Bangkok, the outcome
will either be life imprisonment

397
00:35:47,880 --> 00:35:51,600
or the death penalty.
No one is coming to help you.

398
00:36:12,680 --> 00:36:13,640
I'll leave this to you.

399
00:36:16,040 --> 00:36:17,040
Sure.

400
00:36:57,440 --> 00:36:59,320
It will take a long time to reach Bangkok.

401
00:37:00,480 --> 00:37:01,480
Eat something.

402
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:10,720
I'm sure

403
00:37:11,840 --> 00:37:14,960
you're not loyal to Vijarn.

404
00:37:15,680 --> 00:37:20,040
Why do you choose to die
rather than testify against him.

405
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:23,480
Hatred.

406
00:37:24,960 --> 00:37:26,320
Vijarn might be corrupt,

407
00:37:27,520 --> 00:37:30,440
but he is less evil
than criminals in uniform like you.

408
00:37:31,880 --> 00:37:33,160
I would rather die

409
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:35,160
than cooperate with you.

410
00:37:37,640 --> 00:37:40,000
I do not know your past

411
00:37:40,600 --> 00:37:42,720
or why you hate the authorities.

412
00:37:44,520 --> 00:37:49,000
But your actions
help spread that hellish drug.

413
00:37:50,200 --> 00:37:52,480
Many people die because of it.

414
00:37:55,480 --> 00:37:56,600
I think…

415
00:37:57,840 --> 00:38:00,080
that is definitely more evil than us.

416
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:31,160
Hey. Get out!

417
00:38:34,240 --> 00:38:36,280
Stay still. Don't move!

418
00:38:38,240 --> 00:38:39,280
Turn around!

419
00:38:57,520 --> 00:38:58,360
Mr. Vijarn.

420
00:39:20,640 --> 00:39:22,160
Thank you, sir.

421
00:39:22,840 --> 00:39:24,040
It is fine.

422
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:26,560
Sorry for being late.

423
00:39:26,640 --> 00:39:28,720
I just found out you're alive.

424
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:34,680
If you'd known sooner, would you
have come to help me or kill me?

425
00:39:36,200 --> 00:39:37,840
I'm not Ms. Fuangfah.

426
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:40,000
If I wanted to kill you,
I could do it now.

427
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:42,320
Right?

428
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,160
As for the District Chief,

429
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:57,000
I apologize in advance.

430
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:03,400
Even if I die, you will not survive.

431
00:40:05,240 --> 00:40:08,920
Someone will eventually drag
an evil person like you to prison.

432
00:40:10,040 --> 00:40:12,400
But that will be many years
from now, District Chief.

433
00:40:13,240 --> 00:40:15,560
After you're dead.

434
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,200
Hey.

435
00:41:00,240 --> 00:41:02,280
Perfect. I told you I'm good with rifles.

436
00:41:19,560 --> 00:41:20,480
Escape first, sir.

437
00:41:21,600 --> 00:41:23,520
I will buy you some time. Go.

438
00:41:24,120 --> 00:41:26,320
Surrender. There is no escape.

439
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:31,400
Without a witness,

440
00:41:32,800 --> 00:41:34,120
I might survive.

441
00:41:54,000 --> 00:41:56,840
Are you trying to silence me? Vijarn?!

442
00:42:13,920 --> 00:42:18,080
Stop! Hands up! Drop your guns!

443
00:42:49,000 --> 00:42:51,440
If you change your mind
about giving a statement,

444
00:42:53,240 --> 00:42:54,960
read and sign it.

445
00:43:04,360 --> 00:43:07,680
Being a witness
doesn't just save your life,

446
00:43:09,640 --> 00:43:13,680
but it also saves many people
from dying because of Vijarn's drugs.

447
00:43:17,280 --> 00:43:20,880
Ask your heart
what your thief's dignity is worth.

448
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:25,520
Because in the end,
neither Fuangfah nor Vijarn

449
00:43:25,600 --> 00:43:27,120
will ever value you.

450
00:43:58,320 --> 00:43:59,320
Are you not reading it?

451
00:43:59,400 --> 00:44:02,400
No need. Just take me away.

452
00:44:08,880 --> 00:44:12,040
Mr. Thatri, we're ready
to take Vijarn's men to the station.

453
00:44:14,080 --> 00:44:15,440
Thank you, Sergeant.

454
00:44:22,160 --> 00:44:23,360
Give it here!

455
00:44:23,440 --> 00:44:27,200
Damn it! Give me!

456
00:44:27,280 --> 00:44:29,520
It drives a person
to beat their own mother.

457
00:44:29,600 --> 00:44:30,800
That's your own family!

458
00:44:30,880 --> 00:44:32,960
It turns human beings into monsters.

459
00:44:33,560 --> 00:44:35,000
You're that drug addict!

460
00:44:39,720 --> 00:44:41,000
This is your plan?

461
00:44:47,040 --> 00:44:50,080
Speak the lines
and act as realistically as possible.

462
00:44:51,080 --> 00:44:52,920
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

463
00:45:01,080 --> 00:45:04,800
Staging a play to deceive Zhang Gong Cheng
like this, will it work?

464
00:45:06,160 --> 00:45:07,640
We have to try.

465
00:45:08,440 --> 00:45:11,680
From his history,
his father was addicted to opium,

466
00:45:11,760 --> 00:45:14,000
to the point of killing
everyone in the family.

467
00:45:14,680 --> 00:45:16,320
This might be his weakness.

468
00:45:16,400 --> 00:45:19,760
And if we hit the right spot,
he might change his mind to help us.

469
00:45:23,920 --> 00:45:25,760
I'm afraid that it will not succeed.

470
00:45:26,880 --> 00:45:28,600
I have prepared a backup plan.

471
00:45:29,480 --> 00:45:32,160
I had Rajit trick Vijarn into coming
to rescue Zhang Gong Cheng.

472
00:45:32,240 --> 00:45:34,680
The authorities requested
our transport to Bangkok

473
00:45:35,280 --> 00:45:37,960
for a high-profile suspect.

474
00:45:38,040 --> 00:45:39,480
May I ask who it is?

475
00:45:39,560 --> 00:45:41,640
The pirate, Zhang Gong Cheng.

476
00:45:41,720 --> 00:45:44,720
Then we counter-plan.
If Vijarn comes by himself,

477
00:45:44,800 --> 00:45:46,360
we might be able to catch him.

478
00:45:46,440 --> 00:45:47,600
But if not,

479
00:45:47,680 --> 00:45:50,720
it is possible that he might send someone
to silence Zhang Gong Cheng.

480
00:45:51,520 --> 00:45:54,560
By that time, Zhang Gong Cheng
will probably have no other choice

481
00:45:54,640 --> 00:45:56,120
but to help us.

482
00:46:02,120 --> 00:46:03,560
You tricked me, Thatri!

483
00:46:03,640 --> 00:46:04,960
Calm down.

484
00:46:06,080 --> 00:46:08,920
You helped both the government
and yourself.

485
00:46:09,000 --> 00:46:11,600
It is a win-win situation.
Why are you angry?

486
00:46:13,680 --> 00:46:16,120
You tricked me into confessing.
Thatri! You scoundrel!

487
00:46:16,200 --> 00:46:19,760
You were stubborn,
so this method had to be used.

488
00:46:19,840 --> 00:46:23,320
And I can tell
that you do not like illegal drugs.

489
00:46:24,880 --> 00:46:26,840
Becoming a witness to prosecute them

490
00:46:26,920 --> 00:46:29,320
is equal to helping people
from becoming slave to the drug.

491
00:46:31,520 --> 00:46:33,440
Consider it as cleansing your sins.

492
00:46:35,040 --> 00:46:36,000
Let me go!

493
00:46:36,080 --> 00:46:39,440
Let me go! Thatri! You!

494
00:46:42,360 --> 00:46:43,520
Thatri!

495
00:46:56,160 --> 00:46:58,680
I made a lot.
If it is not enough, let me know.

496
00:46:58,760 --> 00:46:59,880
Whoa.

497
00:47:00,560 --> 00:47:02,280
I've been starving for many years.

498
00:47:02,880 --> 00:47:07,000
The war is finally over.
I will eat it all.

499
00:47:08,160 --> 00:47:11,080
Consider it a celebration
for handling a wicked man like Mr. Vijarn.

500
00:47:12,400 --> 00:47:14,200
Well said. Come here.

501
00:47:14,280 --> 00:47:16,080
In honor of speaking well…

502
00:47:17,360 --> 00:47:19,200
-Here…
-Thank you.

503
00:47:19,280 --> 00:47:20,520
I give you just one.

504
00:47:22,240 --> 00:47:24,360
-Here, I let you choose.
-Thank you.

505
00:47:24,440 --> 00:47:25,480
Well,

506
00:47:25,560 --> 00:47:27,920
Paetai actually gave you one whole shrimp.

507
00:47:28,000 --> 00:47:30,360
It's a blessing. Don't forget
to keep it for worship.

508
00:47:31,520 --> 00:47:32,440
Sure thing.

509
00:47:37,520 --> 00:47:39,240
I did not expect it either,

510
00:47:39,320 --> 00:47:42,120
that a person like the lawyer
could do something like this.

511
00:47:42,800 --> 00:47:44,960
We truly don't know one's true colors.

512
00:47:46,280 --> 00:47:47,800
Nobody expected it at all.

513
00:47:47,880 --> 00:47:50,880
For me, by the time I realized it,
I was almost in deep trouble.

514
00:47:52,040 --> 00:47:55,000
It is good that I had Rajit's help
to make him let his guard down.

515
00:47:55,080 --> 00:47:57,480
Otherwise, pulling off his mask
would not have succeeded.

516
00:47:59,760 --> 00:48:02,520
But we still can't catch him anyway.

517
00:48:02,600 --> 00:48:04,280
So, don't go to Chiang Mai just yet.

518
00:48:04,360 --> 00:48:06,600
Stay until everything is sorted out.

519
00:48:07,520 --> 00:48:08,560
Right?

520
00:48:08,640 --> 00:48:10,120
-Please.
-Right?

521
00:48:11,200 --> 00:48:12,160
I can't.

522
00:48:13,200 --> 00:48:15,840
I have been here for too long.
I have to go anyway.

523
00:48:32,920 --> 00:48:34,480
I must excuse myself.

524
00:48:35,640 --> 00:48:37,440
I feel unwell.

525
00:48:45,720 --> 00:48:47,800
Oh, what is wrong with her?

526
00:48:55,920 --> 00:48:56,760
That's right.

527
00:48:56,840 --> 00:49:00,480
There is nothing to miss anymore.
Why stay here any longer?

528
00:49:09,160 --> 00:49:10,200
Don't cry out for help,

529
00:49:10,800 --> 00:49:12,080
if you don't want to die.

530
00:49:16,240 --> 00:49:17,400
Come here.

531
00:49:23,800 --> 00:49:24,920
Walk faster.

532
00:49:27,440 --> 00:49:29,320
You hurt my niece's feelings too much.

533
00:49:29,840 --> 00:49:33,000
Speaking like that,
it's like she has no meaning.

534
00:49:36,000 --> 00:49:37,520
There's nothing left to worry about.

535
00:49:38,120 --> 00:49:40,720
In what status do you want me to stay?
As your friend?

536
00:49:41,480 --> 00:49:43,800
That means I live off my friend.

537
00:49:45,320 --> 00:49:47,960
And what if you stay because of Rajit?

538
00:49:53,040 --> 00:49:56,000
Because of her,
that is why I must leave quickly.

539
00:49:57,560 --> 00:49:58,640
Why?

540
00:49:59,880 --> 00:50:02,360
Because I want to prove myself
that I'm worthy of her.

541
00:50:03,880 --> 00:50:06,280
Love and living together,

542
00:50:06,880 --> 00:50:10,040
they're two overlapping matters,
but they're not the same thing.

543
00:50:14,320 --> 00:50:16,640
Love uses only the heart.

544
00:50:18,120 --> 00:50:21,480
But to live together,
there must be more than that.

545
00:50:22,960 --> 00:50:24,000
You failed before,

546
00:50:24,760 --> 00:50:26,840
so you built up a wall instead.

547
00:50:36,920 --> 00:50:38,640
But if you've thought it through,
suit yourself.

548
00:50:39,680 --> 00:50:42,720
But at least, go talk to Rajit.

549
00:50:42,800 --> 00:50:46,040
Don't make my niece
keep guessing what you're thinking.

550
00:50:57,760 --> 00:50:59,520
Help me! Help!

551
00:51:01,200 --> 00:51:02,920
You struggle so much!

552
00:51:07,560 --> 00:51:09,960
Are you going to kill me? Huh?

553
00:51:10,040 --> 00:51:12,800
Kill? I won't do that.

554
00:51:14,240 --> 00:51:15,800
It's too easy

555
00:51:16,640 --> 00:51:19,360
for the favorite granddaughter
of that old hag.

556
00:51:21,520 --> 00:51:22,480
Right now,

557
00:51:23,000 --> 00:51:25,120
I have nothing left to lose!

558
00:51:26,880 --> 00:51:28,000
But at least,

559
00:51:29,160 --> 00:51:31,200
I have ruined you

560
00:51:32,040 --> 00:51:34,600
and killed that old man with my own hands.

561
00:51:34,680 --> 00:51:35,920
I finally got my revenge.

562
00:51:38,120 --> 00:51:41,040
You… You killed my Grandpa?!

563
00:51:41,640 --> 00:51:44,840
Yes. I killed him myself.

564
00:51:46,920 --> 00:51:50,360
I'd been planning to kill him for a year.

565
00:51:51,480 --> 00:51:55,640
I gave him tea mixed with poison,
a little at a time, to let him die slowly.

566
00:51:56,240 --> 00:51:59,080
But it is a pity,
it would have been more satisfying

567
00:51:59,160 --> 00:52:02,360
if his assets, the money-grubber's assets,
had become mine.

568
00:52:08,200 --> 00:52:11,240
No wonder. You courted me

569
00:52:11,840 --> 00:52:14,120
because you wanted
my grandfather's wealth!

570
00:52:16,880 --> 00:52:19,200
Serves you right,
because you will never get it.

571
00:52:19,280 --> 00:52:20,600
I almost got it!

572
00:52:21,200 --> 00:52:24,800
If only Som had not repented
and given half the property to Thatri.

573
00:52:24,880 --> 00:52:28,000
And then there was
that fake Thatri, so annoying!

574
00:52:28,080 --> 00:52:30,040
Otherwise, I would've taken you long ago.

575
00:52:33,400 --> 00:52:34,960
Even if I have no one,

576
00:52:35,680 --> 00:52:37,600
I won't look at a man like you.

577
00:52:38,280 --> 00:52:39,640
You're only good at backstabbing.

578
00:52:40,160 --> 00:52:41,920
You don't deserve to call yourself a man!

579
00:52:54,440 --> 00:52:56,240
Am I a man?

580
00:52:57,520 --> 00:52:59,520
-Argh!
-Stay away, Vijarn!

581
00:53:06,560 --> 00:53:08,600
Stop! Please!

582
00:53:08,680 --> 00:53:10,080
Am I a man?

583
00:53:10,680 --> 00:53:12,040
You'll know right now.

584
00:53:21,080 --> 00:53:22,080
Rajit.

585
00:53:25,720 --> 00:53:28,480
Rajit. I have something
I want to talk to you.

586
00:53:32,680 --> 00:53:33,560
Rajit.

587
00:54:26,240 --> 00:54:28,480
Don't cry out for help,
if you don't want to die.

588
00:54:29,720 --> 00:54:30,680
Come here.

589
00:54:48,440 --> 00:54:49,320
Hurry up.

590
00:54:52,040 --> 00:54:54,720
Alright, I know. Just walk ahead.

591
00:54:55,600 --> 00:54:57,520
Help!

592
00:55:23,960 --> 00:55:25,360
Don't come near me.

593
00:55:26,200 --> 00:55:28,200
-Let's continue.
-Stop!

594
00:56:03,480 --> 00:56:04,400
Rajit.

595
00:56:06,480 --> 00:56:08,520
<i>Vijarn snuck in to attack me,</i>

596
00:56:09,120 --> 00:56:11,000
but Uncle Ree arrived in time to help.

597
00:56:11,080 --> 00:56:13,800
<i>Right now, he's chasing after Vijarn.</i>

598
00:56:13,880 --> 00:56:15,040
It's likely over.

599
00:56:15,120 --> 00:56:17,400
And the people who brought in
these illegal drugs,

600
00:56:18,360 --> 00:56:20,200
<i>will they give up easily?</i>

601
00:56:20,280 --> 00:56:22,120
It's been a long time, Sathit.

602
00:56:22,200 --> 00:56:24,240
<i>You said you would go to Chiang Mai.</i>

603
00:56:24,320 --> 00:56:26,520
<i>That's an excellent way</i>
<i>to break someone's heart.</i>

604
00:56:26,600 --> 00:56:28,440
<i>I couldn't even protect</i>

605
00:56:28,520 --> 00:56:30,000
<i>my parents' immense wealth.</i>

606
00:56:30,080 --> 00:56:31,520
So how could I take care of you?

607
00:56:31,600 --> 00:56:33,680
But I love you, Uncle Ree.

608
00:57:07,680 --> 00:57:09,680
Subtitle translation by:
Khathathong Thongtumlueng
